# EKS-A Baremetal IPv6 Provisioning POC - Plan of Action

## Goal
Prove that Tinkerbell (smee) can PXE boot a real baremetal server over IPv6 in DEN080 lab, loading HookOS end-to-end.

## Success Criteria (Phase 1)
Server powers on via IPMI (IPv4 BMC) -> NIC does PXEv6 -> smee responds via DHCPv6 -> iPXE loads over IPv6 -> fetches HookOS kernel/initrd over IPv6 -> HookOS boots.

## Phase 2 (follow-on)
Workflow execution (tink-worker -> tink-server gRPC) runs over IPv6.

