## Week 2: DHCPv6 Implementation in Smee

### Day 4-6: DHCPv6 Handler

Code location: smee/internal/dhcp/

- [ ] Add DHCPv6 handler package (parallel to existing handler/reservation):
      - New file(s): smee/internal/dhcp/handler/reservation6/ (or extend existing)
      - Handle DHCPv6 message types: Solicit -> Advertise, Request -> Reply
      - Construct IA_NA option with IPv6 address from Hardware CRD (read via ConvertByMac)
      - Set DHCPv6 option 23 (DNS recursive name servers)
      - Set DHCPv6 option 59 (Boot File URL): e.g. http://[fd00:80:66::2]:8080/ipxe/binary/ipxe.efi
      - Generate server DUID (can be DUID-LLT based on smee's MAC, or hardcode for POC)
      - Hardcode preferred/valid lifetimes for POC (e.g. 3600/7200)

- [ ] Update conv.go toDHCPData() to populate prefix length from new CRD field
- [ ] Add DHCPv6-specific fields to data.go DHCP struct (PrefixLength int, or separate struct)

