## Key Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Likelihood | Mitigation |
|------|-----------|------------|
| Server firmware lacks PXEv6 boot ROM | Low (Dell iDRAC usually has it) | Check on Day 1 before any other work |
| iPXE needs RA before DHCPv6 | Medium | Run radvd with M-flag on admin machine |
| iPXE DHCPv6 option 59 parsing bugs | Medium | Fall back to RA with TFTP boot file info |
| Admin machine network access to IPv6 VLAN | Low | Verify trunk/tagged config early |
| Upstream PR #445 fields insufficient | Low | Can extend locally; POC validates this |

